### FAQ API Testing

### 1. Get All FAQ Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get FAQ Categories with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories?page=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get FAQ Categories with Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories?searchTerm=General
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get FAQ Categories by Active Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories?isActive=true
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get FAQ Category by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Create New FAQ Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Technical Support",
  "description": "Technical issues and troubleshooting",
  "sortOrder": 5,
  "isActive": true
}

### 7. Update FAQ Category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "General Information",
  "description": "General questions about the platform",
  "sortOrder": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

### 8. Toggle Category Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories/1/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Get Questions by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories/1/questions
Accept: application/json

### 10. Get Questions by Category with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories/1/questions?page=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get Question by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/questions/1
Accept: application/json

### 12. Create New Question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "questionText": "How do I reset my password?",
  "answerText": "You can reset your password by clicking on the 'Forgot Password' link on the login page.",
  "isActive": true,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 13. Update Question
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/questions/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "questionText": "How do I reset my password?",
  "answerText": "You can reset your password by clicking on the 'Forgot Password' link on the login page and following the instructions sent to your email.",
  "isActive": true,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 14. Toggle Question Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/questions/1/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 15. Search Questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/search?searchTerm=password
Accept: application/json

### 16. Get Frequently Asked Questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/frequently-asked?limit=5
Accept: application/json

### 17. Get FAQ Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 18. Get Categories with Question Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories-with-counts
Accept: application/json

### 19. Delete Question
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/questions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 20. Delete Category (only if no questions)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/faq/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Variables
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@authToken = your_jwt_token_here

